Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:27:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] 02-rights r5: record kinds 114-119 per ws04's allocation
 rev 3; 0xFE test

ws04's provisional ABI allocation (rev 3, 2026-11-06, 8e96f24d) gives
the Grant records kinds 114-119 (8 has 104, 10 has 105-113). The six
CqKinds move from 200-205; the highest kind (events::MAX_KIND_V2,
cqlog::MAX_KIND) goes from 205 to 119. Tags 0xD0-0xD5 and errors
200-213 already match the allocation. The Grant keeps its own magic
PSF2GRNT; AccountKind 24 stays a reservation (not in the shared enum
while the Grant is not adopted).

The unknown-instruction test also uses 0xFE, the tag the allocation
keeps unassigned for verifier tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C5Nj2bMRw3LSNvj17s1QPg
